Node ID=10 the chain
Text=Rhea says there is one great chain and everything has its place on it, and we are above you and you are above the sheep. I asked her where the ogres go and she said below humans, and Tereo laughed at that for a long time, so I do not think anybody truly knows. You are smaller than she made you sound. And you do not smell as bad as Mathuo says.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Do you agree with her?
Go to node ID=11 no name yet

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=What do you make of the humans in the pen?
Go to node ID=40 the pen

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=That is the kindest thing a titan has said to me. Goodbye.
Go to node ID=100 Goodbye
Icon=Exit Icon
