------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=11 no name yet
Text=I am one hundred and forty years old and I have no name, so I am not permitted an opinion. When I have earned one I am going to be Atlas. Rhea says that is ambitious and Tereo says nobody ever earned a name by announcing it, so I have stopped announcing it. Do not tell them I told you.
Should Have Voiceover=0

