Node ID=12 Tereo
Text=No, but he stands at the road and asks every creature that comes up it what it wants, and he has not squashed one of you yet, and Rhea says that is what earning looks like from the inside. I would rather have squashed something by now. I expect that is the whole problem.
Should Have Voiceover=0

