Node ID=20 caught
Text=<The young titan's whole face goes stony.> It was one mouthful. One. And Mathuo keeps a whole stash of it in that cul-de-sac on the southeast edge, wedged in the rocks where he thinks nobody has looked, so I do not see why one mouthful should cost me a lecture and my afternoon. Do not tell Rhea we spoke of it.
Should Have Voiceover=0

