Node ID=30 mercury
Text=<He looks at the flask, and then at the path to the south, and then at the flask again.> ...Give it here. Quickly. If Rhea comes past, you were showing me a human trinket and I was being polite to it. You are a better fleshling than the others. I will tell you something for it: Baktron and Klao stand up at the north end all day saying the elders are cowards and that the tribe should go down to that other human town now and take it. The elders say wait. Nobody asks me, but I would not stand near those two.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=That is worth a flask. Enjoy it.
Go to node ID=100 Goodbye
Icon=Exit Icon
Is Default Reply=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=What do you make of the humans in the pen?
