Node ID=40 the pen
Text=Rhea says they are a herd and you do not ask a herd what it wants. Tereo says they are people who have been unlucky, which is not the same thing at all, and when I said so Rhea made me write out the chain of being twice. The one that cries at night is smaller than I am. I have not worked out what that means yet.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=It means she is a child, like you.
Go to node ID=41 like me

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Nothing. Do not think about it.
Go to node ID=100 Goodbye
Icon=Exit Icon

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Work it out. Goodbye.
Go to node ID=100 Goodbye
