------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=41 like me
Text=...I am not a child, I am one hundred and forty. But I take your meaning and I do not care for it. If you are going to do something about that pen, small one, do it while Poimaino is at his silver and do not tell me about it first. Then I will not have lied to anybody.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=You are going to be a better titan than your elders.
